# Single source of truth for the Helios KMD driver version.
#
# This file is the only place the Windows release version is edited:
#   - metadata/windows_resource.rs -> KMD + all four UMD FILEVERSION / PRODUCTVERSION
#                                     numerics and FileVersion / ProductVersion strings
#   - metadata/Read-HeliosMetadata.ps1 -> ADL shim version + package version checks
#   - kmd_render/Cargo.make.toml -> top-level `env_files` (NOT a [config] key вЂ”
#                                   cargo-make ignores it there), consumed by the
#                                   stampinf `-v` that stamps the INF DriverVer
#   - tools/win-mcp (win_build_kmd) -> reads and rewrites it when bumping
#
# An INF DriverVer that disagrees with the image FILEVERSION is FAILED_ADD
# 0xc0000182 at install, discovered only after a reboot. Until 2026-07-26 this
# was five hand-edited literals across two files.
#
# The wiring is checked by kmd_render/build.rs (`verify_version_wiring`), so it
# holds for a hand-run `cargo make` too вЂ” it does not depend on the win-mcp
# server's bump tool.
HELIOS_KMD_VERSION=22.22.289.0

